# @[Name] mentions show as @Name on a highlight, without the brackets: at the start of
# a message, in the middle, with spaces in the name, wrapped over lines, with an emoji,
# cut short, and next to ordinary text with brackets.
rx dm 0 @[Rose01] wassup
rx dm 0 @[Rose01] >Hello Hello
rx dm 0 @[News Junkie Portable] Cool!
rx dm 0 @[T Deck Rover] yes Beautiful day here in Torrance, Crisp clear air
rx dm 0 thanks @[Alice Kestrel] and @[Bob] for the help 🪶
rx dm 0 @[A mention with a very long name that has to wrap over more than one line] ok
rx dm 0 plain [brackets] and an email a@b.c stay as typed
wait 200
wait 200
key enter
key down 6
shot mentions-1
key down 6
shot mentions-2
key down 6
shot mentions-3
